# Keep the build context small: never bake caches, the dev virtualenv, build
# artifacts, or secrets into the image. The Dockerfile does COPY . ./ from this
# server/ context, so without this every stray __pycache__ (including leftovers
# from deleted modules) would end up in the image.
#
# The shared trigger engine ships as the vendor/agent-lm-packages submodule; its
# source is copied, only its build artifacts are excluded below.

# Python bytecode + caches
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Editable-install / build artifacts (regenerated by pip install -e in the image)
*.egg-info/
**/*.egg-info/

# Local dev virtualenv (large, and never belongs in the image)
.venv/

# Submodule git metadata (the gitlink file, not real source)
**/.git

# Secrets / local env
.env
.env.*
